{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Resource Resolution and Web Content","description":"Separate resource authority from representation so Twilite can resolve tlz, HTTP, graph, HTML, image, and unavailable web resources coherently.","graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content","version":"0.1.0","kind":"graph","created":"2026-09-17T15:11:00.000Z","modified":"2026-09-17T15:11:00.000Z","tags":["idea","twilite","browser","resources","http","html","resolution"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"resource-resolution-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Resource Resolution and Web Content Declaration","position":{"x":-850,"y":-1050},"width":360,"height":240,"ports":[{"id":"default-view","label":"default view","direction":"output","dataType":"any","angle":165},{"id":"summary-view","label":"summary view","direction":"output","dataType":"any","angle":180},{"id":"icon-view","label":"icon view","direction":"output","dataType":"any","angle":195},{"id":"glyph","label":"glyph","direction":"output","dataType":"any","angle":270},{"id":"landing-surface","label":"landing surface","direction":"output","dataType":"any","angle":0}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content","name":"Resource Resolution and Web Content","version":"0.1.0","description":"Separate resource authority from representation so Twilite can treat the Web as a native resource space."},"intent":{"kind":"graph","scope":"public"},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","view","content","glyph","idea","idea-problem","idea-proposed-approach","idea-assumption","idea-risk","idea-next-step"],"skills":["idea-template"],"portContracts":["core"]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true}},"settings":{"snapToGrid":false,"gridSize":20,"edgeRouting":"auto","autoSave":false},"declaration":{"kind":"graph","targetMode":"artifact","artifactKind":"graph","interfaceContract":{"version":1,"implicitRootPort":true},"defaultSurfaceId":"default-view","surfaces":[{"id":"default-view","kind":"view","label":"Resource Resolution","viewNodeId":"resource-resolution-detail-view"},{"id":"summary-view","kind":"view","label":"Resolution Summary","viewNodeId":"resource-resolution-summary-view"},{"id":"icon-view","kind":"view","label":"Resolution Icon","viewNodeId":"resource-resolution-icon-view"},{"id":"glyph","kind":"view","label":"Resolution Glyph","viewNodeId":"resource-resolution-glyph"},{"id":"landing-surface","kind":"view","label":"Resolution Landing","viewNodeId":"resource-resolution-landing-surface"}]}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-detail-view","type":"view","label":"Resource Resolution Detail","position":{"x":-300,"y":-950},"width":700,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"},"content":{"kind":"markdown","value":"# Resource Resolution and Web Content\n\nTwilite should separate **where a resource is resolved** from **what representation was returned**. `tlz:` means Twilite is the authority. `https:` means resolve through HTTP. A `.node` or graph media type opens as a graph; HTML becomes a node inside Twilite; images, text, PDFs, and other media receive appropriate representations. A resource that cannot be read remains a valid resource with an unavailable representation."}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-summary-view","type":"view","label":"Resource Resolution Summary","position":{"x":460,"y":-950},"width":620,"height":280,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"},"content":{"kind":"markdown","value":"## Core model\n\n**Address → Authority / Resolver → Resource → Media Type → Representation**\n\nThe scheme chooses the authority. The response identifies the resource representation. Twilite stays the browser."}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-icon-view","type":"view","label":"Resource Resolution Icon","position":{"x":-300,"y":-600},"width":380,"height":250,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"},"content":{"kind":"svg","value":"<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 320 220'><rect width='320' height='220' rx='28' fill='#0f172a'/><circle cx='74' cy='110' r='34' fill='#2563eb'/><circle cx='246' cy='110' r='34' fill='#7c3aed'/><path d='M108 110 H212' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='8' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M190 88 L216 110 L190 132' fill='none' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='74' y='118' text-anchor='middle' fill='#fff' font-family='system-ui' font-size='24' font-weight='800'>URL</text><text x='246' y='118' text-anchor='middle' fill='#fff' font-family='system-ui' font-size='21' font-weight='800'>NODE</text></svg>"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-glyph","type":"glyph","label":"Resource Resolution Glyph","position":{"x":160,"y":-600},"width":240,"height":200,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"},"glyph":{"kind":"icon","name":"Globe2"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-landing-surface","type":"content","label":"Resource Resolution Landing","position":{"x":480,"y":-600},"width":640,"height":250,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"},"content":{"kind":"markdown","value":"# The URL names the resource. Twilite decides how to experience it.\n\nProtocols identify authorities. Media types identify representations. Graphs, HTML pages, images, documents, and inaccessible resources all remain first-class addressable things."}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-idea","type":"idea","label":"Authority and Representation Are Orthogonal","position":{"x":-180,"y":-200},"width":460,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Authority and Representation Are Orthogonal","statement":"Twilite should resolve a resource according to its address scheme, then choose a node representation according to the returned resource type rather than treating protocols as UI navigation commands.","status":"framed","confidence":"promising","notes":"`tlz:` is a Twilite graph authority, not shorthand for opening twilite.zone in a conventional browser. HTTP is likewise a resolver, not synonymous with HTML.","definitionKey":"idea","_classBinding":{"key":"idea","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-problem","type":"idea-problem","label":"Protocols Are Being Confused with Presentation","position":{"x":-720,"y":180},"width":440,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Protocols Are Being Confused with Presentation","statement":"Current navigation semantics risk treating `tlz:` as a browser redirect and `http(s):` as an instruction to leave Twilite, collapsing resource authority, transport, media type, and presentation into one decision.","impact":"Twilite cannot become a coherent browser if address schemes dictate presentation instead of resolving resources.","urgency":"high","definitionKey":"idea-problem","_classBinding":{"key":"idea-problem","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-problem.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-approach","type":"idea-proposed-approach","label":"Resolve First, Represent Second","position":{"x":-220,"y":180},"width":460,"height":320,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Resolve First, Represent Second","description":"Implement a resource pipeline: Address → Authority / Resolver → Resource → Media Type → Representation. `tlz:` resolves resources stored at Twilite.zone. `github:` resolves through GitHub. `file:` resolves locally. `http(s):` resolves through the Web. After resolution, graph content opens as a graph; `text/html` becomes a Web Content node; `image/*`, PDF, text, video, and other supported media select appropriate representations.","differentiator":"Twilite remains the environment in which foreign resources are experienced instead of delegating ordinary Web navigation to another browser.","definitionKey":"idea-proposed-approach","_classBinding":{"key":"idea-proposed-approach","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-proposed-approach.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-html","type":"idea-proposed-approach","label":"HTML Is a Resource Node","position":{"x":300,"y":180},"width":460,"height":320,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"HTML Is a Resource Node","description":"A successfully resolved HTML page should appear as a node in Twilite. The same resource may expose rendered-page, extracted-document, and source representations. Links discovered in HTML are relationships to additional addressable resources and should pass through the same resolution pipeline.","differentiator":"The Web becomes a foreign resource graph that Twilite can traverse and represent rather than a boundary that ejects the user from Twilite.","definitionKey":"idea-proposed-approach","_classBinding":{"key":"idea-proposed-approach","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-proposed-approach.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-assumption","type":"idea-assumption","label":"Resource Identity Survives Representation Failure","position":{"x":-480,"y":560},"width":440,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Resource Identity Survives Representation Failure","assumption":"A resource should remain valid and navigable even when Twilite cannot fetch, frame, authenticate, execute, or otherwise render its preferred representation.","status":"untested","validation":"Test inaccessible HTML cases and verify that Twilite preserves the URL/resource identity while presenting an unavailable representation with useful status and an external-open escape hatch.","definitionKey":"idea-assumption","_classBinding":{"key":"idea-assumption","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-assumption.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-risk","type":"idea-risk","label":"The Web Is Hostile to Embedded Rendering","position":{"x":20,"y":560},"width":440,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"The Web Is Hostile to Embedded Rendering","description":"CSP, X-Frame-Options, CORS, authentication, bot protection, client-only JavaScript, redirects, and unusual content negotiation can prevent direct fetch or rendering.","likelihood":"high","impact":"medium","mitigation":"Model these as representation-capability failures, not invalid resources. Preserve identity and metadata, expose an unavailable/error representation, and allow richer resolvers or authenticated/server-side capabilities later.","definitionKey":"idea-risk","_classBinding":{"key":"idea-risk","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-risk.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}},{"id":"resource-resolution-next-step","type":"idea-next-step","label":"Codex: Define the Resolver Contract","position":{"x":520,"y":560},"width":460,"height":320,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Codex: Define the Resolver Contract","action":"Inspect the existing navigation, address parsing, graph loading, and representation-selection code. Define the smallest resolver contract that separates scheme/authority from returned media type. Implement `tlz:` as a real Twilite-owned graph authority and route HTTP resources through type-based representation selection. Add an HTML/Web Content representation and an unavailable-resource representation before expanding extraction or server-side fetching.","expectedEvidence":"A `tlz:` graph resolves from Twilite-owned storage; an HTTP `.node` or graph media type opens as a graph; readable HTML renders as a Twilite node; and blocked/unreadable HTML produces a stable resource node with an unavailable representation rather than ejecting navigation or destroying identity.","status":"todo","definitionKey":"idea-next-step","_classBinding":{"key":"idea-next-step","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-next-step.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"resource-resolution-and-web-content"}}}],"edges":[{"id":"resource-resolution-decl-detail","type":"default-view","source":"resource-resolution-declaration","target":"resource-resolution-detail-view","sourcePort":"default-view","targetPort":"root","label":"","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-decl-summary","type":"reference","source":"resource-resolution-declaration","target":"resource-resolution-summary-view","sourcePort":"summary-view","targetPort":"root","label":"summary","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-decl-icon","type":"reference","source":"resource-resolution-declaration","target":"resource-resolution-icon-view","sourcePort":"icon-view","targetPort":"root","label":"icon","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-decl-glyph","type":"reference","source":"resource-resolution-declaration","target":"resource-resolution-glyph","sourcePort":"glyph","targetPort":"root","label":"glyph","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-decl-landing","type":"reference","source":"resource-resolution-declaration","target":"resource-resolution-landing-surface","sourcePort":"landing-surface","targetPort":"root","label":"landing","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-problem-idea","type":"idea.motivates","source":"resource-resolution-problem","target":"resource-resolution-idea","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"motivates","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-approach-idea","type":"idea.advances","source":"resource-resolution-approach","target":"resource-resolution-idea","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"advances","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-html-approach","type":"idea.advances","source":"resource-resolution-html","target":"resource-resolution-approach","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"specializes","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-idea-assumption","type":"idea.assumes","source":"resource-resolution-idea","target":"resource-resolution-assumption","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"assumes","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-risk-approach","type":"idea.threatens","source":"resource-resolution-risk","target":"resource-resolution-approach","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"threatens","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-next-assumption","type":"idea.tests","source":"resource-resolution-next-step","target":"resource-resolution-assumption","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"tests","style":{},"data":{}},{"id":"resource-resolution-next-idea","type":"idea.advances","source":"resource-resolution-next-step","target":"resource-resolution-idea","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"advances","style":{},"data":{}}],"clusters":[],"settings":{"snapToGrid":false,"gridSize":20,"edgeRouting":"auto","github":{"repo":"mikemartinez1974/public","path":"ideas/resource-resolution-and-web-content/root.node","branch":"main","seedOnCommit":false},"autoSave":false},"scripts":[]}